---
description: >-
  A single "cell" service connected to two others ("colspan" and "rowspan")
  with differently-sized labels on the R/L and B/T ports, checking that edge
  length adapts to the label/node sizes rather than using a fixed length
  that would overlap or leave excess gaps.
---
architecture-beta
  service cell[Table Cell]
  service colspan[colspan]
  service rowspan[rowspan]
  cell:R --> L:colspan
  cell:B --> T:rowspan
